{"summary":"Chameleon Run is a unique, fast and challenging runner with a colorful twist.","description":"Chameleon Run is a unique, fast and challenging autorunner with a colorful twist. Jump, switch and run through expertly crafted levels that will have you running back for more.\n\nYour goal is to switch your color to match the ground as you run and jump from platform to platform. Sounds easy right? Well think again!\n\nFeatures\n\n- Fast paced running, jumping and switching colors\n- Fun jumping mechanics like \"double jump\" and \"head jump\"\n- Pixel perfect physics\n- Stylish, super smooth and colorful graphics\n- Non-linear levels with 3 special objectives in each one\n- Compete for the fastest time on each level\n- Simple two button controls","esrbNotes":null,"pegiNotes":null,"iapPrices":null,"video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/DrIAedC-wJY?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/PmDzDPsec6lPyp1I02uuzTVrrPZE3jrOjtULHutW-fJNSfQTlLmfPEzsBwaE6PTeA4srFitBQBoXOJikYrtBug","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/bmVO9CrEH1O3F8LlcxUzZUhGZE1fHqJaquz4oBitrd4VWOnVu4CdTbIT1-FvlzXA51XDKSMP5ogo3si4Gl5B-Q","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/PHXD0RLKZfzAzuwn2pf9zmtSYYnyopgvyfVY4nOg9cerSAXRAZqxlVQu_cfG9JDe8bURxdWgFc35lPHYCxIQnQ","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/oSv5Zgn9yUo6cjbZzuH6ydl4EFnrjsPMPQziGcB-5K2txw0z7i0lblg6POr6bLzyBor8tUh0nsNE0Iag7wKS","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/ih9G1SvYLDxCsfB8dFm9gezYLcoQmEQVcCa4tEtVxGrT-wgw4sXegjEIFq2KRlcpMjYxTdd9AcqPR-X2KApVFSo","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Gtnaixqo5AYxwEvvUdRJ1pszHLzGXr2kxTLKI1J9yOb_rTkNtst-UUom1mbo4VuYJOLfI2TBLfAZ2fyZ7cSa","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/lnG1K9gZSghL8xx2UJdd2R9G1woOzS6ZLq5luN5kHV8cZ8a6bKvOL-Jc4kFSHQG1_FnVHpXMBtVhmTC_HGqcdw","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/J7jVrA1cYgsD4WSwKK-Wb0THg3HHpm0AroyXpAI9eHSrwwKl9QTok-bd1QliWlXDivHLIwhRpHtkTX0FqkaHCJc","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/dUrsdNRkDbmaODKPhdKz7